OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be a mostly dry day
OL,6,Fwith variable amounts of cloud and
OL,7,Fsome sunny intervals. Chance of a
OL,8,Flight shower at first this morning,
OL,9,Fand again along the west coast later
OL,10,Fthis afternoon.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA few showers along the west
OL,13,Fcoast overnight, otherwise mainly dry.
OL,14,FFreshening southerly winds will bring
OL,15,Foccasional rain to the Western Isles
OL,16,Fand Skye later. Chilly in the east.
OL,17,
OL,18,CThursday:FA cloudy day with outbreaks
OL,19,Fof rain spreading east through the
OL,20,Fmorning followed by a few showers in
OL,21,Fthe afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
